---
// Minimal divider: thin line · small dot · thin line
---

<div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-3 py-1 line-divider" aria-hidden="true">
  <span class="line"></span>
  <span class="dot"></span>
  <span class="line"></span>
</div>

<style>
  .line-divider { color: var(--color-bronze); opacity: 0.45; }
  :global(.dark) .line-divider { color: var(--color-foreground); opacity: 0.25; }
  .line-divider .line {
    width: 56px;
    height: 1px;
    background: currentColor;
  }
  .line-divider .dot {
    width: 3px;
    height: 3px;
    border-radius: 9999px;
    background: currentColor;
  }
</style>
